Provides: pkgsel
Description: Select and install packages (Athena fork)
 Athena's fork of upstream Debian pkgsel.  Single functional change
 from upstream 0.79: the `DEBIAN_TASKS_ONLY=1` env prefix on the
 in-target tasksel invocation in debian/postinst is removed —
 athena-tasksel ignores that env var anyway, but removing the
 setter makes the install flow's intent explicit.
 .
 Provides + Conflicts + Replaces pkgsel so the installer ramdisk
 resolves to this fork and upstream pkgsel cannot coexist.  This
 replaces the previously-shipped patch/source/pkgsel/9001-... quilt
 patch (deleted in the same commit).
